    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2271_8613.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich nachbarlich willig
<lb n="2"/>dienst zuvor, fürsichtig, eersam,
<lb n="3"/>und weis, besonders liebe gute
<lb n="4"/>freündt und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wiewohl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürkomung</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>deß verderblichen beschwaerlichen müntz-
<lb n="7"/>wesens, guete lobliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mandata</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordnungen</unclear> und
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">publicirt</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeschlagen</unclear> worden, in hoffnung
<lb n="10"/>es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hirdurch</unclear> allerley steygerung
<lb n="11"/>und eigennütziger wechßel und gelt-
<lb n="12"/>gemangel fürkomen werden, in-
<lb n="13"/>massen wie dann in unser statt
<lb n="14"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viel</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewest</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halten</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">persohnen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierwider</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mandats</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuwider</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehandlet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dergleichen</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wechßel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhaefft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoeher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">straffe</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesehen</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nichtsdestoweniger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> so
<lb n="22"/>kompt uns für, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetzunder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahero</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>allerley gattung, insonderheit aber
<lb n="24"/>Pündtnerischen, sowohl am hall als
<lb n="25"/>an der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzahl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geringhaltige</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schlechte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halbe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dicken</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">batzen</unclear>,
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bringen</unclear> in unsere statt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gar</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2271_8614.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachtheil</unclear> und schaden deß armen
<lb n="29"/>gemeinen manns eingeschleichen, da
<lb n="30"/>hingegen die guetten muentz uffge=
<lb n="31"/>wechßlet und verfueert werde.
<lb n="32"/>Deßhalben wir veruhrsacht worden,
<lb n="33"/>fernners gebuerende Insehen zuthun
<lb n="34"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nacherforschung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuhalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wer</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>doch sollich unweehschafft gelt
<lb n="36"/>in unser statt bringen und gegen
<lb n="37"/>guetten muentzen verwechßlen und
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgeben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Da</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesterigstags</unclear> under andern
<lb n="40"/><persName resp="#ner">Jacob Soler</persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-65" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herisaw</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angegeben</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>, daß derselbig dergleichen
<lb n="42"/>einer sein, und allbereit etlich 200.
<lb n="43"/>angedeütter pfundner weihser drey=
<lb n="44"/>baetzner dieselben gegen thalern
<lb n="45"/>zuverwechßlen, in unserer statt
<lb n="46"/>ligend haben solle. Dahero
<lb n="47"/>wir ihme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alßbalde</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niderlegen</unclear>, und ihne uff heüt dato
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheiden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, und mit
<lb n="50"/>allem ernst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwornen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leiblichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eyd</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">examinirt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woher</unclear> er mit solcher muentz
<lb n="52"/>khomen, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dargegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sorten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffwechßlen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuege</unclear>. Der
<lb n="54"/>hat uns nun frey uff disen be=
<lb n="55"/>richt geben.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2271_8615.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="56"/>daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">600</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alle</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sackhe</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> in die <orgName resp="#ner">Eppeleische</orgName>
<lb n="59"/>schreibstuben in <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">E. Wht.</orgName>
<lb n="60"/>statt, gehoere, mit denen er
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jezt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gute</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">her</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehandlet</unclear>,
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleiche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Muenz</unclear> von ihnen emp=
<lb n="63"/>fangen, und ihnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hargeg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aller</unclear>,
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gute</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sorten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thaler</unclear> und der,
<lb n="65"/>gleichen in <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">uewre statt</placeName>, unnd
<lb n="66"/>ins landt oftermals wollt und
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugefuehrt</unclear> habe.
<lb n="68"/>Wann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">empfangener</unclear>
<lb n="69"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">münze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suendern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfahrde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>,
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bejagen</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neweangestel</unclear>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierzu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verordnete</unclear>
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">probieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear>
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solch</unclear> auß der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bijlag</unclear>
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grosg</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvhrnemen</unclear>, In,
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uetrundter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lisster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Neuen</unclear>
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loetig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">th</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">58</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>.
<lb n="77"/>uff die Warckh genz,
<lb n="78"/>befelcht. Unnd wir
<lb n="79"/>nuen Iß fuerkhunfftig dise
<lb n="80"/>unlidenliche bschwerlichkheit
<lb n="81"/>zuefueren, der sach mit ernst
<lb n="82"/>nachzusezen, unnd die Ihenige
<lb n="83"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dergleichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schlechte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> zu
<lb n="84"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geringkhltige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Muenz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="85"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußlandt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bringkh</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgibuhrlicher</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2271_8616.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="86"/>zehaben.
<lb n="87"/>So gelangt an E. F. Wht. Wht.
<lb n="88"/>unser freuendtnachbarlichs ersuechen,
<lb n="89"/>die woellendt bi den ihrigen in
<lb n="90"/>S. Geroltischen schreibstuben nachforschung
<lb n="91"/>halten, wie lang und mit waß
<lb n="92"/>tittel, E. W. mit obgedachtem
<lb n="93"/>landtßfuersprechen gehandlet, und
<lb n="94"/>ob die sach seinethalben in ersten
<lb n="95"/>oder andern rechten beschehen sei. Und
<lb n="96"/>unß dann dessen, so sie in erfarung
<lb n="97"/>bringen moechte, bei zaigern unserm
<lb n="98"/>allein deßwegen abgefertigten
<lb n="99"/>statt botten unbeschwert berichten,
<lb n="100"/>damit wir unß fernner
<lb n="101"/>darnach, so wohl gegen ihme alß
<lb n="102"/>andern, seinen wegen, und
<lb n="103"/>diesen und meererem begerenden,
<lb n="104"/>darnach verbuwung kuendten.
<lb n="105"/>Daß seindt umb E. Wht. Wht.
<lb n="106"/>wir in gleichen zustehenden
<lb n="107"/>gelegenheiten, nachbarlichen
<lb n="108"/>zuerwidern willigen ainer-
<lb n="109"/>bietens, unß damit sametlich
<lb n="110"/>Gottes obhalt wohlbevhelende.
<lb n="111"/>Datum <origDate when="1621" resp="#ner">den X s. Junij anno 1621</origDate>.
<lb n="112"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd rhat
<lb n="113"/>zuo St. Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="114"/>An die statt <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Lindauw</orgName>.
</p>
